    "text": "In the Ciphera repository:\n* **`glyph`**: Raw sensor inputs\n* **`sigil`**: Processed classifications\n\n### NodeGate Data Flow\n* **Input**: Reads `glyph` from `/var/ciphera/in/node.glf` using `data.input_path`.\n* **Output**: Writes `sigil` to `/var/ciphera/out/node.sig` using `data.output_path`.\n\n### Specifications\n* **Input Specifications**: Consult the [glyph spec](https://doc.ciphera.invalid/glyph) and select **Raw Glyph**.\n* **Output Specifications**: Consult the [sigil spec](https://doc.ciphera.invalid/sigil) and select **Processed Sigil**.\n\n### Error Handling\nPreserve the following error message:\n`ERR_GLYPH expected glyph got sigil`",
